WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:03.620
Hi, I'm Tilly! Let's look at your key bindings.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:08.141
Control B, then k, lists every binding.

00:00:08.728 --> 00:00:09.688
Type to search them.

00:00:10.904 --> 00:00:13.864
In record mode, press any key to see who owns it.

00:00:15.309 --> 00:00:18.509
Control D releases it, so your shell gets it back.

00:00:19.081 --> 00:00:22.441
And after one control B, the arrows walk through your panes.

00:00:24.012 --> 00:00:26.652
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
